            <p class="kicker project-kicker"><i aria-hidden="true"></i>Open source · Hugging Face · Jan 2026</p>
            <h3>Density vs. Diversity: VLM Curation Datasets</h3>
            <p class="project-desc">Two synthetic spatial-reasoning training sets built from GQA images. One set has ten questions per image, and the other has one. I used them to fine-tune six Qwen3-VL models for a controlled comparison.</p>
            <dl class="metrics">
            <div><dt>Samples per set</dt><dd>15k</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Dense images</dt><dd>750</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Diverse images</dt><dd>7.5k</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Fine-tuned VLMs</dt><dd>6</dd></div>
          </dl>
